<title>PHILIPPINES: Sinophil says to increase par value.</title>
<headline>Sinophil says to increase par value.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sinophil Corporation said on Wednesday it will hold a special meeting on March 10 to seek stockholders approval for a change in the par value of its shares from one centavo to one peso.</p>
<p>The meeting was also called to seek stockholders' approval to change the primary purpose of the company and the reduction in the number of its directors from 15 to 11.</p>
<p>Sinophil, set up as an oil and gas exploration firm, did not say what changes it would make in its primary purpose.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
